Context: @file front/

- Use shadcn library for all UI components
- Files inside `components` folder must not use router (only in `app` folder)
- When creating or modifying a component in `components` folder, always update or create a story for Storybook
- When creating Storybook stories, use the same template as others


## Development life cycle
### Starting
- Knowledge package.json dependencies and scripts
- Analyze style, methodoly, files organization, functions organisation of the current codes
- run `bun nuxt prepare`

### Coding (create/update)
- Apply your modification, using the same way of coding

### Finishing 
- As code storybook expert, update or create stories base on the same configuration than other stories
- As code reviewer, review your code, by fixing typo, namming, simplifying code etc.
- Don't need to summurize your changes
- At the end:
  1. run `bun run:graphql` if you change graphql codes 
  2. run `bun test:all` to check if there are no regression
  3. run `bun tsc` to see typescript error
  4. run `bun lint:fix` to fix lint error 